      "sourceTextSha256": "6af7f7bc0f6bd1084cd569c0f762d51b7fd04a7b144ccaa351329e8f32ed02f6",
      "text": "After breakfast, set out on a full-day tour with an English-speaking guide and private transport.\n\nIn the morning, visit Corcovado and the Christ the Redeemer statue. From the viewing platform, you can see Copacabana, Ipanema, Leblon, the Botanical Garden and the ocean. Admission tickets are included.\n\nLunch at a traditional Rio restaurant is payable separately.\n\nIn the afternoon, take a city sightseeing tour. The itinerary includes the Metropolitan Cathedral, the Sambadrome, the Municipal Theatre, the National Library, an art museum and other sights.\n\nThe route then takes you to the Urca neighbourhood and Sugarloaf Mountain. From the summit, you can see Rio, its beaches, parks and historic districts.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-32of1ztisn",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      }
